# WP FastY — core

Monorepo: WordPress **theme generator** on UI8Kit Codegen Latte primitives.

## Layers

```
packages/ui8kit-codegen/       → SOURCE (submodule)
.workspaces/ui8kit-latte/      → Layer 1 (never hand-edit)
presets/                       → Layer 2 (layouts × blocks × styles)
themes/<slug>/                 → Layer 3 (PHP + thin views)
.workspaces/theme-builder/     → assembler CLI
```

## Commands

```bash
bun run ui:primitives    # regenerate Latte bundle
bun run ui:install       # composer in ui8kit-latte
bun run theme:build -- <id>
```

## Always

- Context via PHP `ContextFactory` only — no WP queries in Latte
- Compose with `{include 'brick/Part.latte', …}` + `{capture}` for children
- Layout shell: `{wp_head}`, `{body_class}`, `{wp_footer}`
- Deep docs: `docs/` · constructor KB: `.project/`

## Never

- Hand-edit `.workspaces/ui8kit-latte`
- React→Latte / `data-slot` semantic CSS pipelines
- Ship codegen TypeScript inside a theme zip
- Treat dirty experimental theme views as the design system (reference is `themes/latte`)
